#: ../../quick-reference.rst:1
msgid "Part XI: Quick Reference Card"
msgstr "第XI部：早見表"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:4
msgid ""
"Keep beside a terminal: build, run, configure, route, observe, and "
"diagnose. Part X holds the full tables; this card holds what an operator "
"types."
msgstr ""
"ターミナルのそばに置いてください。ビルド、実行、設定、ルーティング、観測、診断を扱います。完全な表は第X部にあります。この早見表には、運用者が入力するものをまとめています。"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:6
msgid "Build"
msgstr "ビルド"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:9
msgid ""
"cargo build --release -p sibuna                          # daemon + SQLite "
"+ console\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --no-default-features    # in-memory, no "
"external crate\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --features postgres-tls  # shared "
"PostgreSQL clusters\n"
"rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown   # or set SIBUNA_POW_WASM / "
"SIBUNA_CONSOLE_WASM\n"
"cargo test            # unit, live daemon, storage and console tests\n"
"cargo clippy --all-targets && cargo fmt --check\n"
"cargo xtask check     # 70-line / 1,408-line / 99-column gate\n"
"cargo xtask browser   # headless Chromium checks\n"
"cargo xtask bench product   # whole products under wrk -> "
"benchmarks/results/\n"
"guidedog build        # this book (guidedog dsc: the SID records)"
msgstr ""
"cargo build --release -p sibuna                          # "
"デーモン+SQLite+コンソール\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --no-default-features    # インメモリ、外部クレートなし\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --features postgres-tls  # "
"共有PostgreSQLのクラスター\n"
"rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown   # またはSIBUNA_POW_WASM / "
"SIBUNA_CONSOLE_WASM\n"
"cargo test            # 単体、稼働中のデーモン、ストレージ、コンソールのテスト\n"
"cargo clippy --all-targets && cargo fmt --check\n"
"cargo xtask check     # 70行 / 1,408行 / 99桁の検査\n"
"cargo xtask browser   # ヘッドレスChromiumでの検査\n"
"cargo xtask bench product   # wrkによる製品全体の測定 -> benchmarks/results/\n"
"guidedog build        # 本書（guidedog dsc：SIDの記録）"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:22
msgid "Run"
msgstr "実行"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:25
msgid ""
"# Shield (default): PoW + WAF, proxy to :3000\n"
"sibuna -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Gate: PoW only\n"
"sibuna --gate -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Forward auth behind Nginx/Caddy (trusts X-Forwarded-For)\n"
"sibuna -m forward_auth --host 127.0.0.1 -p 8080 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Edge: persistent policies, reputation, forensics in <dir>/sibuna.db\n"
"sibuna -D /var/lib/sibuna -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# JA4 from a trusted ingress (Cloudflare's header; nginx module: x-ja4; "
"ATS: ja4)\n"
"sibuna --ja4-header cf-ja4 --trust-forwarded -p 8080 -u 3000 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Cluster member: shared PostgreSQL, unique node id\n"
"sibuna --database-url-file /etc/sibuna/database-url --cluster-node 1 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret"
msgstr ""
"# Shield（標準）：PoW + WAF、:3000へプロキシ\n"
"sibuna -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Gate：PoWのみ\n"
"sibuna --gate -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Nginx/Caddyの後ろでforward auth（X-Forwarded-Forを信頼する）\n"
"sibuna -m forward_auth --host 127.0.0.1 -p 8080 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Edge：<dir>/sibuna.dbに永続的なポリシー、レピュテーション、フォレンジック\n"
"sibuna -D /var/lib/sibuna -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# 信頼できるイングレスからのJA4（Cloudflareのヘッダー。nginxモジュール：x-ja4、ATS：ja4）\n"
"sibuna --ja4-header cf-ja4 --trust-forwarded -p 8080 -u 3000 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# クラスターのメンバー：共有PostgreSQL、一意なノードID\n"
"sibuna --database-url-file /etc/sibuna/database-url --cluster-node 1 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:41
msgid "Console (opt-in preview)"
msgstr "コンソール（オプトインのプレビュー）"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:44
msgid ""
"# Initialize while the daemon is stopped, then start the console\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"
msgstr ""
"# デーモンを停止した状態で初期化し、その後コンソールを起動する\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:50
msgid ""
"Open ``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` and replace the temporary "
"password. Add ``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198`` to place the node on "
"the globe. Remote access requires an HTTPS proxy, an explicit origin and "
"trusted-proxy CIDRs; follow Part IX. SID 0007 is Committed. The console "
"passes its browser workflows in headless Chromium (SID 0010, criterion 5); "
"its formal performance isolation gate remains open (Part VIII)."
msgstr ""
"``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/``\\ を開き、一時パスワードを変更します。\\ "
"``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198``\\ を加えると、ノードを地球儀上に配置します。リモートからのアクセスには、"
"HTTPSプロキシ、明示的なオリジン、信頼するプロキシのCIDRが必要です。第IX部に従ってください。SID 0007はCommittedです。"
"コンソールはヘッドレスChromiumでのブラウザーのワークフローに合格しています（SID 0010、基準5）。"
"正式な性能分離の判定はまだ完了していません（第VIII部）。"

